---
// The public Story URL dropped its id segment (see
// supabase/migrations/0003_unique_article_slugs.sql). Anything still
// pointing at the old two-segment shape - a bookmark, a share sent before
// this changed, a search engine's cached link - lands here and is sent on
// to the current URL rather than 404ing.
return Astro.redirect(`/story/${Astro.params.slug}`, 301);
